C("A download URL is exactly https://dl.test/ followed by a canonical integer 1 to 99 and either .zip or .tar.gz. No query, fragment, port or credentials.",r"https:\/\/dl\.test\/[1-9][0-9]?\.(?:zip|tar\.gz)","https://dl.test/1.zip|https://dl.test/1.tar.gz|https://dl.test/99.zip|https://dl.test/99.tar.gz|https://dl.test/10.zip|https://dl.test/20.tar.gz|https://dl.test/9.zip|https://dl.test/50.tar.gz","http://dl.test/1.zip|https://dlXtest/1.zip|https://dl.test/0.zip|https://dl.test/100.zip|https://dl.test/01.zip|https://dl.test/1.tarXgz|https://dl.test/1.ZIP", "Treat multi-part extensions as literal components.")
