C("A simplified HTML tag pair is an opening tag with a lowercase ASCII name 1 through 8 letters, then 1 through 20 ASCII letters or spaces, then a closing tag with the exact same name. No attributes, nesting or newlines.",r"<([a-z]{1,8})>[A-Za-z ]{1,20}<\/\1>","<a>x</a>|<div>Hello</div>|<span>a b</span>|<abcdefgh>ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRST</abcdefgh>|<p> </p>|<x>abc</x>|<article>Note</article>|<b>Bold</b>","<a></a>|<a>ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTU</a>|<abcdefghi>x</abcdefghi>|<a>x</b>|<A>x</A>|<a>1</a>|<a>x\ny</a>", "Opening and closing names must agree, and body constraints are independent.")
