C("Validate exactly /tenant/<name>/mirror/<name>, where both names are the same lowercase ASCII slug of 3 to 8 letters. The reserved names admin and root are forbidden; no other components or trailing slash.",r"\/tenant\/(?!admin\/|root\/)([a-z]{3,8})\/mirror\/\1","/tenant/abc/mirror/abc|/tenant/xyz/mirror/xyz|/tenant/abcdefgh/mirror/abcdefgh|/tenant/adminx/mirror/adminx|/tenant/roots/mirror/roots|/tenant/foo/mirror/foo|/tenant/team/mirror/team|/tenant/widget/mirror/widget","/tenant/admin/mirror/admin|/tenant/root/mirror/root|/tenant/abc/mirror/xyz|/tenant/ab/mirror/ab|/tenant/abcdefghi/mirror/abcdefghi|/tenant/ABC/mirror/ABC", "Exclude exact reserved names, not their prefixes.")
C("A two-parameter query is ?left= and a canonical integer 1 to 99, then &right= and another such integer. Values must differ; parameter order is fixed and no extra parameter is allowed.",r"\?left=([1-9][0-9]?)&right=(?!\1$)[1-9][0-9]?","?left=1&right=2|?left=99&right=98|?left=1&right=10|?left=10&right=1|?left=20&right=30|?left=9&right=99|?left=5&right=50|?left=50&right=5","?left=1&right=1|?left=99&right=99|?left=0&right=1|?left=1&right=100|?left=01&right=2|?right=2&left=1", "Inequality compares whole values, not prefixes.")
